e.
> > Step 2's name is: "Early Access"
> > Step 3's name is: "Preview"
> > Step 4's name is: "Production Ready"
> >
> > These names are aligned with what we've been using up until now. Let's
> now
> > discuss the suitability of these names.
> >
> > Thanks!
