Chia-Ping Tsai resolved KAFKA-17589.
------------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.0
         Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai  (was: David Arthur)
       Resolution: Fixed

> Move JUnit extensions to test-common module
> -------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17589
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17589
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>            Reporter: David Arthur
>            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.0.0
>
>
> Create a new Gradle module "test-common" where our JUnit extensions and annotations can live. This module should have minimal dependencies.
> In order to avoid compile-time dependencies on "core" for ClusterTestExtension, we can leverage JUnit automatic extension loading with SPI https://junit.org/junit5/docs/current/user-guide/#extensions-registration-automatic
> We can also use this module as a place to keep a single copy of junit-platform.properties



