Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17718:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: build code with JDK 17
                 Key: KAFKA-17718
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17718
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


JDK 21 does not run the spotless check because the version of the spotless plugin we are using doesn't support JDK 21. KAFKA-16896 will update the plugin to support JDK 21 once JDK 8 is removed.

To avoid spotless errors, we should temporarily run the build with JDK 17.



