Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394

Lianet Magrans created KAFKA-17726:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: New consumer subscribe/subscribeFromPattern in backgr=
ound thread
                 Key: KAFKA-17726
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17726
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Lianet Magrans


There are still some calls to change the subscriptionState subscription in =
the app thread, that could lead to race-conditions given that the subscript=
ion state object is shared between the background and app thread and is mos=
tly updated in the background. We should consider moving the subscriptionSt=
ate.subscribe() and subscribeFromPattern calls to the background.

[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/5624bc7c7e43339eb64e18491ac5039324e50=
678/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/Async=
KafkaConsumer.java#L1465]

[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/5624bc7c7e43339eb64e18491ac5039324e50=
678/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/Async=
KafkaConsumer.java#L1703]

[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/5624bc7c7e43339eb64e18491ac5039324e50=
678/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/clients/consumer/internals/Async=
KafkaConsumer.java#L1736]

One option would be to use the existing SubscriptionChangeEvent, perform th=
e subscription (and metadata) changes in the AppEventProcessor (where unsub=
scribe already takes place).=C2=A0

Note that these calls are closely related to metadata object calls, to requ=
est metadata for new topics and "maybeUpdateSubscriptionMetadata". We shoul=
d maybe consider moving them together to the background (where the metadata=
 object is also updated).=C2=A0 [https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/5624b=
c7c7e43339eb64e18491ac5039324e50678/clients/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/=
clients/consumer/internals/AsyncKafkaConsumer.java#L1703-L1705]=C2=A0



