l and with a broker restart the log dir became online again.=20
Investigating the issue, it's seems very similar to KAFKA-15391=C2=A0and, s=
pecially, with KAFKA-15572. The main difference on the logs between the iss=
ue we encountered and the one described at KAFKA-15572 is that there the ex=
ception that marked the log dir as offline was a `java.nio.file.NoSuchFileE=
xception`. In our case, we had a `java.nio.channels.ClosedChannelException`=
:
{noformat}
[2024-10-03 09:48:04,704] ERROR Error while flushing log for mytopic-20 in =
dir /data/0/kafka with offset 844857727 (exclusive) and recovery point 8448=
57727 (org.apache.kafka.storage.internals.log.LogDirFailureChannel)
java.nio.channels.ClosedChannelException
