Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit

Hi,

I'd like to propose doing a 3.7.2 bug-fix release and I would volunteer 
to be the release manager for it. We did just fix a critical client bug 
for 3.8.1 and 3.9.0 and we believe that it justifies a 3.7.2 release 
(3.6 is not affected).

If no one has any objections, I will send out a release plan some time 
next week, and I would like to encourage everybody to back-port existing 
bug-fixed from new branches to make the release stronger.

We do already have 12 closed Jiras for 3.7.2 but the more the better, 
and it seems there is a few more (I did find at least 4 more Jiras) 
which seems candidates for back-porting.


Looking forward to your feedback.


-Matthias

