I also wanted to note that 3.9.0-RC2 doesn't include David's fix for KAFKA-17193. Since that PR only affects our integration with Github Actions and not the Java or Scala source code of Kafka, I did not re-generate the release candidate tar.gz and/or tags after that fix was made.

