             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
          Components: consumer
            Reporter: Arpit Goyal


In the AbstractHeartBeatRequestManager  , I observed we are not setting the right heartbeat request interval. Is this intentional ?
[~lianetm] [~kirktrue]
{code:java}
long retryBackoffMs = config.getLong(ConsumerConfig.RETRY_BACKOFF_MS_CONFIG);
        long retryBackoffMaxMs = config.getLong(ConsumerConfig.RETRY_BACKOFF_MAX_MS_CONFIG);
        this.heartbeatRequestState = new HeartbeatRequestState(logContext, time, 0, retryBackoffMs,
                retryBackoffMaxMs, maxPollIntervalMs);
{code}




