Thanks for testing. control.plane.listener is not (and never has been) s=
upported in KRaft mode. You have to remove control.plane.listener config=
urations before migrating. I filed KAFKA-17790 to document this in the m=
igration instructions. (This is not a blocker for the release, though.)

best,
Colin

