While messing around with the release candidate, I found a separate bloc=
ker bug: KAFKA-17794.

Basically, our behavior is confusing when we format the storage director=
y with KIP-853 (dynamic controller quorum), but no initial controllers a=
re supplied. I have a PR which requires the initial controllers to be in=
itialized in this case (since otherwise, it does not work).

best,
Colin

On Mon, Oct 14, 2024, at 16:34, Colin McCabe wrote:
> On Mon, Oct 14, 2024, at 15:04, Jakub Scholz wrote:
