             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: core
            Reporter: Jun Rao


Currently, ReplicaManager.completeDelayedOperationsWhenNotPartitionLeader i=
s called when (1) a replica is removed from the broker and (2) a replica be=
comes a follower replica and it checks the completion of multiple purgatori=
es.=C2=A0 However, not all purgatories need to be checked in both situation=
s. For example, the fetch purgatory doesn't need to be checked in case (2) =
since we support fetch from follower now.=C2=A0



