Hi,

We are using kafka stream to consume messages from one kafka topic.

Due to some business logic, we ignore all the packets before 8am by returni=
ng {{-1L}}=C2=A0from=C2=A0{{CustomTimestampExtractor}} for all such packets=
.

We start consuming all the packets after 8am.

Everything is running fine, but consumer lag on my consumer group before 8a=
m keeps increasing and goes to 0 after 8am.


