Some packages in our javadoc don't have a description. For example in [3.9 javadoc|https://kafka.apache.org/39/javadoc/index.html] org.apache.kafka.coordinator.group.api.assignor, org.apache.kafka.streams.processor.assignment, and org.apache.kafka.streams.processor.assignment.assignors are missing a description
 
All public packages should have a package-info.java file with a description.



