With command ./gradlew :streams:test --tests DefaultStateUpdaterTest.shouldGetTasksFromRestoredActiveTasks

> Test failure: DefaultStateUpdaterTest.shouldGetTasksFromRestoredActiveTasks  expected: <2> but was: <3>
> -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-17402
