Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17888:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: e2e should support to run <2.3 kafka under JDK 11
                 Key: KAFKA-17888
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17888
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


zookeeper client 3.4.x can't run under JDK 17 (see https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-3779), but kafka 2.1 ~ 2.3 are using zk 3.4.x. However, kafka 2.1 is the new baseline (https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-14560)

Hence, we can't drop 2.1 ~ 2.3 from e2e and they must run under JDK 11



