> Currently, ReplicaManager.completeDelayedOperationsWhenNotPartitionLeader=
 is called when (1) a replica is removed from the broker and (2) a replica =
becomes a follower replica and it checks the completion of multiple purgato=
ries.=C2=A0 However, not all purgatories need to be checked in both situati=
ons. For example, the fetch purgatory doesn't need to be checked in case (2=
) since we support fetch from follower now.=C2=A0



