> >>>>
> >>>>
> >>>> An overview of the release can be found in our announcement blog pos=
t:
> >>>> https://kafka.apache.org/blog#apache_kafka_381_release_announcement
> >>>>
> >>>> You can download the source and binary release (Scala <VERSIONS>)
