Hi Andrew,

Thanks for reviewing the KIP.

AS1: Updated to KIP-559. Thanks for pointing that out.
AS2: Yes, that is correct. The error code is a performance optimization to
avoid unavailability for 5 minutes when a proxy may be able to tell the
client to rebootstrap immediately.

Regards,

Rajini



