Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-17906:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: remove redundant sourceSets from build.gradle
                 Key: KAFKA-17906
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17906
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai


according to https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/building_java_projects.html#sec:compile, the following `sourceSets` is totally equal to the default setting. So we should remove them from build.gradle

  sourceSets {
    main {
      java {
        srcDirs = ["src/main/java"]
      }
    }
    test {
      java {
        srcDirs = ["src/test/java"]
      }
    }
  }




