             Summary: Align string conversion of SharePartitionKey
                 Key: KAFKA-17912
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17912
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Andrew Schofield
            Assignee: Andrew Schofield
             Fix For: 4.0.0


PlaintextAdminIntegrationTest.testShareGroups has started failing because the "wrong coordinator" is being sent requests which causes this test to time out.

It looks like two incompatible string representations of SharePartitionKey is the problem. For a single broker cluster, it all seems to work. This test has 3 brokers and the problem seems to occur.



